{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-07_end","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-07","title":"沉默者之怒-2","storyCode":"7-9","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"43504fd204edec9b8553236d76752bea9161710fc36799de7a31a205e2d74655","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"切尔诺伯格仓库  12:40  a.m."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大量的仓库和储存设备......这里应该是仓库区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"循着这条路，我们就可以直达中央区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！过来看看。仓库里面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"尖锐的刃形法术和打斗痕迹。迅速解决了两三个整合运动，都被丢在这边了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，拜托你和医疗干员。这几个整合运动也许有我们需要的信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这里也能看到陈长官的痕迹......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是血迹。她受了伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里，血迹在这里有沉积，但只到这里为止。她给自己止了血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"离开现场的只有一个人，只可能是陈长官了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......千万要撑到我们来，陈长官......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"又要我们做这事儿？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"怎么感觉以前也发生过。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......在切城时，嗯，也是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过那时候，陈长官可以一人处理一支松散的整合运动小队......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在的形势已经完全不同了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那时我们还只是单纯的合作关系。我只是刚刚开始了解陈长官是怎样的一个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但这里已经是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......平民？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪里出来的？我们居然没找到他们的藏身处......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是乌萨斯人的坟场！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（保持戒备......但别攻击！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是中立的感染者查验组织！女士，我们是本着为你们提供救助的原则进入这座城市的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"作为普通感染者，我们对你没有敌意——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者？呿，我是乌萨斯人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"救助感染者......？！哈，笑话......你们感染者对我们做了什么，你们自己难道不清楚吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，如果你感到不安全，我们就保持现在这个距离。二十米的距离。我们不会再移动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不对，我也是感染者了。我骂不了你，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你们还救助感染者？！呵呵，呵呵呵......所有感染者都该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"我也该死。我也该死！没有感染者，我根本不会染病！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"想着害人，想着报复......感染者就是这样吗？！我也该这样吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿米娅，安抚她，好吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（不，现在不好。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（......让她先发泄吧。一个月来所有的惨痛回忆都刺在她的意识里。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（现在也是她......直面这些事，把这些事都拔出来的机会。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道这里有什么吗，感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"和你一样的感染者，活的感染者还有死的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"因为整合运动只能在这里苟延残喘的感染者，因为整合运动死在这里的无数感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们之前没有人感染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"切尔诺伯格的市民，被他们四处驱赶，四处找出来！最开始是屠杀，然后是折磨，最后是像丢垃圾一样随意处置活下来的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道多少人缺衣少食，死在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"活下来的，也因为不断接触源石，全都感染了！到现在，我已经没看见任何还没被感染者的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你们感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你们感染者！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我们......不用带我们去救治其他人。我们会把必要的医疗援助交给你们。之后，我们立刻就离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_057","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是乌萨斯派的，还是龙门派来的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的是他们，我们应该都已经死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。扫一下他的识别码。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"医生......？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_12"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Guard，解释一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"许久不见，阿米娅，凯尔希医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["？？？","凯尔希","罗德岛近卫干员？","阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]}]}
